            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Yes, that's it. Add it to your DataStore, FileSystems, PersistenceManagers and Cluster journal. Note, however, that the fix version for JCR-2034 is 1.6.0.",
